# Generated model artifacts are intentionally COMMITTED, not ignored:
#   mesh/glb/*, viewer/public/*.glb, viewer/metadata/*.json,
#   cad/procedural/control_skeleton_geometry.json, tests/validation_report.json
# They are reproducible with `python scripts/build_control_skeleton.py`, but are tracked so the
# viewer runs from a clean clone and so changes to geometry show up in review diffs.

